rticle class=3D"style-module-scss-module__nbagBW__learnContent"><header><h1=
>Introduction to Stacks</h1></header><h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>Imagine a stack of plates. You can only add a new plate to the top of th=
e stack, and when you need a plate, you take the one from the top. It=E2=80=
=99s not possible to take a plate from the bottom or middle without first r=
emoving all the plates above it.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
